Flow Home
Id home.main

  Screen Home
  Id home.screen

    Shows
      Time-of-day greeting
      Recommended meditation cards
      Mood selector
      Entry to create a meditation
      Entry to Profile

    Select mood
      Rules
        Mood must be one of Relaxed, At ease, Grounded, Energetic, Focused, Sleepy, Hopeful, Grateful, Just curious
        The selected mood themes the experience
        The selected mood is remembered for later visits

      Store selected mood

    Open create a meditation
      Go to create.choose-focus

    Open Profile
      Go to profile.screen
